  "description": "**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Comico](https://www.comico.kr/comic/1640), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=4498150), [KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/53966373), [Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/comic/ep_list/dry_flower), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/comic/jt_sr_0053), [Anytoon](https://www.anytoon.co.kr/episode_page.html?ind=5220), [Onestory](https://onestory.co.kr/detail/H038814432), [Nate](https://toonnbook.nate.com/detail/H038814432)  \nYou, can you play my dead husband? ]\n\nHan Ga-hee, the owner of a flower shop specializing in dry flowers that asked her to play her dead husband, and Lee Sun-oh, an unknown band actor who should be her perfect husband.  \nThe strange and suspicious cohabitation between the two begins...!\n\nMystery emotional romance between a band actor and a client who plays a dead husband!",
